:: Michael Hang Out End Late High Fun [nobr]

/* Intro */
You and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> decide to take a seat to chill and chat for a minute. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I swear, the dude has it out for me. Like, he’s ALWAYS watching what I’m doing and never anyone else.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> rants about one of his teachers. You point out that he is probably watching <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> since <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> is always the one who is causing trouble. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“That’s offensive but also true. Can’t help it if I’m tend to live an exciting life!”</span> He laughs. You continue chatting for a minute until <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> suddenly notices the time and sighs loudly.<br>

    <<set _ad to [
        {
        Name: "Player",
        State: {
            Mouth: "Smirk",
            },
        },
        {
        Name: "Michael",
        State: {
            Outfit: $HangOutClothes,
            Mouth: "Frown",
            Eyes: "Tired",
            },
        },
    ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>

<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Dude, having a curfew fucking SUCKS!”</span> He slumps down in the chair, scowling. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I mean, we’re pretty much adults now! You’d think we should be in charge of when we go home and go to sleep, right? Fucking lame. Anyways, I better head off so my dad doesn’t chew my head off.”</span> He sighs and stands up.<br>
<br>

<div id="choice">
	<<link "Dare him to skip his curfew<br>">>
    <<replace"#choice">>
        With a smirk, you dare <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> to skip his curfew and stay out for a little longer. What’s the worst that can happen? <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Trust me, my dad’s a dick. If I’m not home, then he can’t go to bed, and the last thing you want is to make my dad sleepy and pissed. Trust me, not worth the trouble.”</span> You call <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> a chicken and he raises an eyebrow at you. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I’m not going to fall for that, you little shit!”</span><br>
        
        <<set _ad to [
