        <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> suddenly grabs you and puts you in a headlock! Holding you tightly and shaking you around before releasing you and laughing. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Good try though. Maybe it’ll work on someone more susceptible than me. Later, loser!”</span> <span style="color:LightGreen"> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> gives you the middle finger as a form of goodbye and you roll your eyes, chuckling to yourself as <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> walks off.</span> <br>
        <br>
        [[Continue|Park]]
    <</replace>>
    <</link>>
	<<link "Surprise hug goodbye<br>">>
    <<replace"#choice">>
        As he is grabbing his things, you sneak up behind <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> and give him a surprise goodbye hug!<span style="color:Pink"> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> stiffs up, raising his arms as he turns around with a raised eyebrow.</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Yo, gaywad, what are you doing?”</span> He asks with slight annoyance. You explain that this is how you say goodbye to your friends.<span style="color:LightGreen"> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> rolls his eyes and tries to wiggle free of your grasp.</span> <br>

        <<set _ad to [
            {
            Name: "Player",
